#. Description of the plugin
#: smart-multistep-lead-forms.php
msgid ""
"Visual multi-step lead forms: drag-and-drop builder with conditional logic, "
"fast accessible frontend, lead CRM with notes and follow-ups, partial-lead "
"recovery, conversion funnel, signed webhooks and abuse-safe e-mails."
msgstr ""
"Visuelle mehrstufige Anfrageformulare: Drag-and-drop-Editor mit "
"Bedingungslogik, schnelles barrierearmes Frontend, Lead-CRM mit Notizen und "
"Wiedervorlagen, Rückgewinnung abgebrochener Anfragen, Conversion-Funnel, "
"signierte Webhooks und missbrauchssichere E-Mails."

#. Author of the plugin
